>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `solver_ss`

``` hol4
simpLib.solver_ss : Traverse.ssolver -> ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Creates a simpset fragment containing one unsafe solver.

`solver_ss solver` is an anonymous fragment; adding it to a simpset adds
`solver` as `add_unsafe_solver` does.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>> val decide = {name = "decide", solve = K DECIDE} : Traverse.ssolver;
>> SIMP_CONV (bool_ss ++ simpLib.solver_ss decide)
     [arithmeticTheory.LESS_MOD] “x MOD (x + 1)”;
```

### See also

[`simpLib.add_unsafe_solver`](#simpLib.add_unsafe_solver),
[`simpLib.safe_solver_ss`](#simpLib.safe_solver_ss).
